<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mount</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>mount &lt;steed&gt;
ride &lt;direction&gt;
dismount
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>mount horse
ride east
dismount
</pre>
<p>When there is an animal capable of carrying you, you can mount it and ride, 
and so save your own endurance. You can't mount another player, and a steed 
won't take you if you are too heavy for it. To get off again, dismount.
</p><p>Steeds are rare in the lands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Movement</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Endurance Points</a>
</pre>




</div>